// # LSP CLI Command Interface - Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Front door for the lsp command surface. Wires the engine to stdio JSON-RPC.
//
// Setup: One command: serve over stdio, or one-shot file mode. --oodar-root loads cap_table.json.
//
// Beats:
//   1. cmd_lsp.oo parses --stdio, --stdlib-root, --oodar-root, and a positional request file.
//   2. main.oo is the binary entry: parse argv, call run_ooda_lsp.
//   3. Missing --oodar-root leaves cap rows empty. Set --oodar-root and a missing file exits 1.
//   4. main() takes CompilerReadCap, ProcessCap, and EnvCap so merge and oodac check can run.

import "cmd_lsp.oo";
import "main.oo";
